{
  "id": 1403,
  "title": "挑战：局部最小值与鞍点",
  "meta_title": "梯度下降优化中的挑战",
  "meta_description": "讨论在优化过程中可能陷入局部最小值或鞍点的问题。",
  "content": "<p>梯度下降 (gradient descent)法依据局部梯度信息，自信地“向下”移动。但如果地形并非一个简单的、平滑的碗状，能直接通向最低点，会发生什么？机器学习 (machine learning)成本函数的优化，特别是复杂的那些，可能出乎意料地崎岖不平。这导致一些潜在的难题：局部最小值和鞍点。</p>\n<h3>局部最小值：陷入“山谷”</h3>\n<p>想象你在浓雾中下山，总是选择你所在位置最陡峭的下坡路。你可能会发现自己身处一个小山谷。感觉像是底部，因为你周围的所有路径都向上。然而，你可能没意识到在别处存在一个更深的山谷，那是该区域真正的最低点（全局最小值）。</p>\n<p>一个<strong>局部最小值</strong>是参数 (parameter)空间中的一个点 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在该点成本函数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\theta^*)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 的值低于所有附近点。然而，远处可能存在另一个点 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^{**}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在该点 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\theta^{**})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 的值甚至更低，这被称为<strong>全局最小值</strong>。</p>\n<p>为什么梯度下降 (gradient descent)会陷入停滞？在局部最小值（以及全局最小值）处，成本函数在所有方向上的斜率都为平坦的。数学上，梯度为零：\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J(\\theta^*) = \\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span>\n回顾梯度下降的更新规则：\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta := \\theta - \\alpha \\nabla J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>\n当 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J(\\theta) = \\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span> 时，更新项 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\nabla J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 变为零，参数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span> 停止改变。算法收敛，但可能收敛到一个由局部最小值的参数所代表的次优解。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-1o1vzvu\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\"data\": [{\"x\": [-3, -2.5, -2, -1.5, -1, -0.5, 0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3], \"y\": [4, 1.25, 0, 0.25, 1, 1.25, 0.5, 0.125, 0, 0.625, 2.25, 4.375, 7], \"mode\": \"lines\", \"name\": \"成本函数 J(θ)\", \"line\": {\"color\": \"#228be6\"}}, {\"x\": [-2, 1], \"y\": [0, 0], \"mode\": \"markers\", \"name\": \"最小值点\", \"marker\": {\"color\": [\"#f03e3e\", \"#37b24d\"], \"size\": 10, \"symbol\": [\"circle\", \"star\"]}}], \"layout\": {\"title\": {\"text\":\"带有局部和全局最小值的成本函数\", \"x\": 0.5, \"xanchor\": \"center\"}, \"xaxis\": {\"title\": \"参数 θ\"}, \"yaxis\": {\"title\": \"成本 J(θ)\"}, \"showlegend\": true, \"legend\": {\"traceorder\": \"normal\", \"items\": [{\"name\": \"局部最小值\", \"visible\": true, \"color\": \"#f03e3e\", \"symbol\": \"circle\"}, {\"name\": \"全局最小值\", \"visible\": true, \"color\": \"#37b24d\", \"symbol\": \"star\"}]}}}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 300px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-1o1vzvu\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 300px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>成本函数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 的一个例子，显示了局部最小值（红色圆圈）和全局最小值（绿色星形）。梯度下降法从左侧区域开始时，可能会收敛到局部最小值，因为那里的梯度变为零。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>对于像线性回归这样具有凸成本函数（形状像一个单一的碗）的简单模型，局部最小值不是一个问题；只有一个全局最小值。然而，对于像神经网络 (neural network)这样复杂的模型，成本曲面是高维且非凸的，可能包含许多局部最小值。有趣的是，研究表明，对于非常大的神经网络，许多局部最小值可能产生与全局最小值几乎一样好的性能，使它们在实践中不如最初担心的那样成为障碍。然而，劣质的局部最小值仍然可能存在并使优化过程陷入停滞，特别是在较小的网络或特定问题类型中。</p>\n<h3>鞍点：“高原”问题</h3>\n<p>高维优化曲面中另一个通常更麻烦的特点是<strong>鞍点</strong>。想象一下马鞍的形状：它沿着马的脊椎向下弯曲，但横跨马背向上弯曲。在马鞍的正中心，地面是平坦的。</p>\n<p>数学上，鞍点是参数 (parameter) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处梯度为零的点，即 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J(\\theta^*) = \\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span>，就像最小值一样。然而，它<em>不是</em>一个最小值，因为尽管函数在某些方向上增加（比如沿着马鞍的侧面向上），它在其他方向上却减少（比如从马鞍的前后滑落）。梯度下降 (gradient descent)法在这里陷入停滞的原因与它在最小值处陷入停滞的原因相同：零梯度会停止更新。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-1fj2b16\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\"data\": [{\"type\": \"surface\", \"x\": [-2.0, -1.5, -1.0, -0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0], \"y\": [-2.0, -1.5, -1.0, -0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0], \"z\": [[0.0, 2.25, 3.0, 3.75, 4.0, 3.75, 3.0, 2.25, 0.0], [-1.75, 0.5, 1.25, 2.0, 2.25, 2.0, 1.25, 0.5, -1.75], [-3.0, -0.75, 0.0, 0.75, 1.0, 0.75, 0.0, -0.75, -3.0], [-3.75, -1.5, -0.75, 0.0, 0.25, 0.0, -0.75, -1.5, -3.75], [-4.0, -1.75, -1.0, -0.25, 0.0, -0.25, -1.0, -1.75, -4.0], [-3.75, -1.5, -0.75, 0.0, 0.25, 0.0, -0.75, -1.5, -3.75], [-3.0, -0.75, 0.0, 0.75, 1.0, 0.75, 0.0, -0.75, -3.0], [-1.75, 0.5, 1.25, 2.0, 2.25, 2.0, 1.25, 0.5, -1.75], [0.0, 2.25, 3.0, 3.75, 4.0, 3.75, 3.0, 2.25, 0.0]], \"colorscale\": [[0, \"#1c7ed6\"], [0.5, \"#dee2e6\"], [1, \"#f03e3e\"]], \"opacity\": 0.9, \"contours\": {\"z\": {\"show\": true, \"usecolormap\": true, \"highlightcolor\": \"#4263eb\", \"project\": {\"z\": true}}}}], \"layout\": {\"title\": {\"text\":\"鞍点示例 (J ≈ θ₁² - θ₂²)\", \"x\": 0.5, \"xanchor\": \"center\"}, \"scene\": {\"xaxis\": {\"title\":\"θ₁\", \"backgroundcolor\": \"#e9ecef\"}, \"yaxis\": {\"title\":\"θ₂\", \"backgroundcolor\": \"#e9ecef\"}, \"zaxis\": {\"title\":\"成本 J(θ₁, θ₂)\", \"backgroundcolor\": \"#e9ecef\"}, \"aspectratio\": {\"x\": 1, \"y\": 1, \"z\": 0.7}}, \"width\": 650, \"height\": 550, \"margin\": {\"l\": 10, \"r\": 10, \"b\": 10, \"t\": 40}}}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 550px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-1fj2b16\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 550px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>一个描绘鞍点在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 附近的曲面图。函数沿一个方向减小（蓝色表示较低成本），但沿另一个方向增加（红色表示较高成本）。在精确鞍点处的梯度为零，导致标准梯度下降法停止。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>为什么在高维空间 (high-dimensional space)中（比如深度学习 (deep learning)中遇到的那些），鞍点通常被认为比局部最小值更具问题？</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>普遍性：</strong> 在高维空间中，鞍点比局部最小值呈指数级地更常见。当梯度为零时，所有方向都向上弯曲（真正的局部最小值）的可能性远小于某些方向向上弯曲而某些方向向下弯曲（鞍点）的可能性。</li>\n<li><strong>减速：</strong> 即使在鞍点处梯度不完全为零，它在其附近也会变得非常小，特别是在那些下降不多的方向上。这会导致梯度下降法显著减速，有时需要不切实际的长时间才能“滚离”鞍点并找到向下的路径。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>标准梯度下降法仅依赖于一阶导数，难以摆脱鞍点，因为当梯度接近零时，它无法明确指示向下弯曲的方向。该算法可能会来回振荡，或者沿着鞍点定义的高原状区域非常缓慢地爬行。</p>\n<h3>识别特点</h3>\n<p>标准梯度下降 (gradient descent)法只使用一阶导数信息（梯度 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span>），而二阶导数（由海森矩阵 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">H</span></span></span></span> 捕获，如第3章所述）则提供有关成本函数曲率的信息，这有助于区分这些点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在<strong>局部最小值</strong>处：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J = \\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span> 且海森矩阵 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">H</span></span></span></span> 是正定的（所有特征值都为正，表示在所有方向上曲率都严格向上）。</li>\n<li>在<strong>局部最大值</strong>处：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J = \\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">H</span></span></span></span> 是负定的（所有特征值都为负，表示曲率严格向下）。</li>\n<li>在<strong>鞍点</strong>处：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla J = \\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">H</span></span></span></span> 是不定的（它既有正特征值也有负特征值，表明在某些方向上曲率向上，而在其他方向上曲率向下）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于典型的机器学习 (machine learning)模型中大量参数 (parameter)来说，直接使用海森矩阵进行优化（比如在牛顿法中）通常计算成本太高。然而，这种理论上的区分有助于解释为什么这些梯度为零的不同类型的点行为不同，以及为什么鞍点对于像梯度下降法这样的一阶方法来说特别棘手。</p>\n<h3>后续展望</h3>\n<p>尽管局部最小值和鞍点确实带来了优化中的挑战，但它们不一定妨碍我们训练出有效的模型。梯度下降 (gradient descent)算法的变体，例如引入<strong>动量</strong>或使用<strong>自适应学习率</strong>（如RMSprop或Adam，深度学习 (deep learning)框架中常见的优化器）的那些，被专门设计用于更有效地应对这些困难区域。这些方法通常会累积过去梯度的信息，或者单独调整每个参数 (parameter)的学习率。这有助于它们建立“速度”以穿过平坦区域或鞍点，并抑制震荡，使它们更容易摆脱鞍点，并可能找到更好的最小值。我们不会在这里详细介绍这些算法，但知道存在解决方案和改进是有益的。</p>\n<p>理解这些潜在的障碍是有效应用和解决机器学习 (machine learning)中基于梯度的优化问题的重要组成部分。识别出你的优化过程可能在鞍点附近大幅减速，或者似乎陷入了局部最小值，使你能够考虑其他优化算法，调整超参数 (hyperparameter)，如学习率，或检查模型或训练过程的其他方面。</p>",
